# #4222 — the crawler writes CodeFile, Test AND LogSource, and runs as kade per
# Jeff's 2026-09-17 ruling (principals own services; a service's rows belong to
# the principal it runs as). kade held Write on code and tests but not logs, so
# every nightly pass lost its log leg: PUT /logs/sources x133 -> 403, measured
# 2026-09-20 07:33. Under the ruling those rows are kade's, so this is the
# missing member of the set, not a widening of it.
chorus:permission-kade-logs a chorus:Permission ;
    rdfs:label "kade may write urn:chorus:domains:logs" ;
    chorus:agent chorus:principal-kade ;
    chorus:accessTo "urn:chorus:domains:logs"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    chorus:mode acl:Write ;
    chorus:ownedBy chorus:principal-silas .

